          "sourceFilename": "1385_find_the_distance_value_between_two_arrays.rs",
          "code": "impl Solution {\n    pub fn find_the_distance_value(arr1: Vec<i32>, arr2: Vec<i32>, d: i32) -> i32 {\n        let mut count = arr1.len() as i32;\n        for a in arr1 {\n            for &b in &arr2 {\n                if (a - b).abs() <= d {\n                    count -= 1;\n                    break;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        count\n    }\n}\n\nstruct Solution {}\n",
